        "url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/product/watercolor-strawberry-pattern-digital/",
        "description": "Soft watercolor strawberry pattern in vintage botanical style with lush sage green leaves, red ripe berries, and delicate white blossoms on a warm cream background.\nThis enchanting surface pattern features hand-painted watercolor strawberries at various stages of ripeness — from deep crimson ripe fruits to blush-toned unripe berries — nestled among broad sage and olive green leaves with graceful curling stems. White five-petal strawberry blossoms with soft yellow centers add a romantic, garden-fresh dimension, while rosy pink flower buds weave throughout the composition. The overall arrangement is lush and organic, with motifs layered at varying scales to create visual depth and a naturalistic, all-over repeat feel.\nThe colour palette is deliberately soft and vintage-inspired: warm cream or antique white background, coral-red and blush-red berries, muted sage and moss greens, creamy white petals, and dusty rose buds. The mood is cottagecore, romantic, and summery — evoking English cottage gardens and French country farmhouse aesthetics. This pattern is perfectly suited for fabric yardage, sublimation printing on tumblers and tote bags, gift wrap, scrapbooking paper, wallpaper, journal covers, stationery, Procreate brushes, Photoshop smart objects, and Canva templates. It works beautifully for spring and summer collections, kitchen textiles, baby nursery decor, and feminine branding projects.",
        "fullDescription": "<p>Soft watercolor strawberry pattern in vintage botanical style with lush sage green leaves, red ripe berries, and delicate white blossoms on a warm cream background.</p>\n<p>This enchanting surface pattern features hand-painted watercolor strawberries at various stages of ripeness — from deep crimson ripe fruits to blush-toned unripe berries — nestled among broad sage and olive green leaves with graceful curling stems. White five-petal strawberry blossoms with soft yellow centers add a romantic, garden-fresh dimension, while rosy pink flower buds weave throughout the composition. The overall arrangement is lush and organic, with motifs layered at varying scales to create visual depth and a naturalistic, all-over repeat feel.</p>\n<p>The colour palette is deliberately soft and vintage-inspired: warm cream or antique white background, coral-red and blush-red berries, muted sage and moss greens, creamy white petals, and dusty rose buds. The mood is cottagecore, romantic, and summery — evoking English cottage gardens and French country farmhouse aesthetics. This pattern is perfectly suited for fabric yardage, sublimation printing on tumblers and tote bags, gift wrap, scrapbooking paper, wallpaper, journal covers, stationery, Procreate brushes, Photoshop smart objects, and Canva templates. It works beautifully for spring and summer collections, kitchen textiles, baby nursery decor, and feminine branding projects.</p>",
